          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Is it better to buy last year's treadmill model?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Frequently yes. Annual refreshes in this category are overwhelmingly console and software changes while the frame, motor, deck and rollers carry over unchanged, so the outgoing model is often mechanically identical for several hundred dollars less. Ask the retailer what changed, and treat a vague answer as meaning the screen.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
